  "id": "sleepiness",
  "term": "sleepiness",
  "definition": "Sleepiness, in this packet, refers to daytime drowsiness or a tendency to feel sleepy during the day. In adolescents, higher daytime sleepiness is described as being linked to slightly poorer cognitive performance, including weaker verbal working memory.",
